===Efficient herb runs===
{{Main|Farming_runs#Herb run}}
In addition to farming trees, a significant amount of Farming experience is obtained from doing herb runs over time. Additionally, farmed herbs are critical for [[Ironman Guide/Herblore|Herblore training]].

For herb runs, get to every patch as quickly as possible, clean herbs and note them on the [[Tool Leprechaun]]. Try to have an anima seed planted in the [[Farming Guild]] for increased herb yield, you'll sustain them by killing [[Hespori]]. You can do limpwurt/snape grass alongside herb runs if you need them. Use [[magic secateurs]] for increased yield. Plant more valuable seeds in the disease-free patches. Only use the Farming Guild patch if your herbs will be done before your next contract.

Teleports from the [[player-owned house]] to herb patches are recommended, especially to [[Weiss]] and [[Troll Stronghold (location)|Troll Stronghold]], to save time and resources having to make the teleports.

With access to [[anima seed]]s, it is recommended to prioritise using [[iasor seed]]s first to decrease crops chance to die, following by [[attas seed]]s to maximise yield, and without either of those, optionally use [[kronos seed]]s to skip growth cycles.

